title: 'Curriculum Embedding Lab — Embed AI in Your Course'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU
url: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU/tree/main/mlu/professional-student-development/mlu-000001-curriculum-embedding-lab
abstract: >-
  A 90-minute faculty lab whose deliverable is a decision, not a demo. Each participant
  builds a working, discipline-grounded AI tool from a persona matched to their field,
  then writes a curriculum plan for where it belongs in a course they actually teach —
  and, explicitly, where it does not. Ships with a student-facing companion notebook (Quiz
  Me, Socratic Hint, Explain-Back) and six licence-clean discipline personas.
